      <p><seg source="#source-970-984">歯科医院</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-984-1022">〔かれ草の雪とけたれば〕</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1022-1030">退耕</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1030-1059">〔白金環の天末を〕</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1059-1067">早春</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1067-1078">来々軒</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1078-1092">林館開業</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1092-1112">コバルト山地</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1112-1126">旱害地帯</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1126-1164">〔鐘うてば白木のひのき〕</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1164-1181">早池峯山巓</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1181-1210">社会主事　佐伯正氏</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1210-1218">市日</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1218-1226">廃坑</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1226-1234">副業</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1234-1248">紀念写真</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1248-1262">塔中秘事</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1262-1306">〔われのみみちにたゞしきと〕</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1306-1311">朝</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1311-1323">〔猥れて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1323-1341"><rb>嘲笑</rb><rt>あざ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1341-1364">めるはた寒き〕</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1364-1375">岩頸列</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1375-1395">病技師〔一〕</seg></p>
